    "title": "LESSON 54: BUILDING WORDS",
    "header_color": "green",
    "pages": [
      {
        "page": 1,
        "total_pages": 2,
        "content": [
          "Any root can take any ending, as long",
          "as the meaning makes sense:",
          "",
          "SUKCES- (success):                    Press 1",
          "sukceso = success      sukcesi = to succeed",
          "sukcesa = successful   sukcese = successfully",
          "",
          "FIN- (end):                           Press 2",
          "fino = end             fini = to finish",
          "fina = final           fine = finally",
          "",
          "A NOUN ROOT BECOMES A VERB:           Press 3",
          "telefono → telefoni = phone → to phone",
          "martelo  → marteli  = hammer → to hammer",
          "krono    → kroni    = crown → to crown"
        ],
        "pronunciation_mappings": {
          "1": "Sukceso. Sukcesi. Sukcesa. Sukcese.",
          "2": "Fino. Fini. Fina. Fine.",
          "3": "Telefono. Telefoni. Martelo. Marteli. Krono. Kroni."
        },
        "pronunciation": "Leciono kvardek ok"
      },
      {
        "page": 2,
        "total_pages": 2,
        "content": [
          "COMPOUNDS glue roots together. The LAST",
          "root is the main one: it says what the",
          "thing IS. The first one narrows it down.",
          "",
          "THE LAST ROOT DECIDES:                Press 1",
          "diskut + rondo  = discussion circle",
          "kontakt + listo = contact list",
          "foto + albumo   = photo album",
          "",
          "AN -O- MAY JOIN THEM, FOR SOUND:      Press 2",
          "lern + o + libro = lernolibro = textbook",
          "",
          "PREPOSITIONS JOIN IN TOO:             Press 3",
          "antaŭ + kondiĉo = antaŭkondiĉo = prerequisite",
          "post + parolo   = postparolo = afterword",
          "ĉe + esti       = ĉeesti = to be present"
        ],
        "pronunciation_mappings": {
          "1": "Diskutrondo. Kontaktlisto. Fotoalbumo.",
          "2": "Lernolibro.",
          "3": "Antaŭkondiĉo. Postparolo. Ĉeesti."
        }
      }
    ]
  },
  {
